---
description: specs/done/ is immutable (AGENTS.md invariant rule 7)
globs: specs/done/**
alwaysApply: false
---
Files under specs/done/ are shipped specs and are IMMUTABLE (AGENTS.md invariant rule 7).
Do not edit, rename, or delete them. If a shipped behavior must change, open a new spec in
specs/active/ that references the shipped one (Supersedes).
